{"task_id": "inq-law-04", "arm": "CONTROL", "output": "The claim is correct. The source excerpts confirm that the EU Artificial Intelligence Act is indeed Regulation (EU) 2024/1689.\n\nVERDICT: SUPPORTED\nKEY: 1689", "attempts": [{"success": true, "failure_class": null, "provider": "kilo-gateway", "model": "poolside/laguna-s-2.1:free", "decision_id": "decision_3af6633c01ee410c8c82c52db1629918"}], "grounded_source_refs": ["https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/regulatory-framework-ai", "https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/d79f3e5d-41bc-11f0-b9f2-01aa75ed71a1/language-en", "https://fra.europa.eu/en/law-reference/regulation-eu-20241689-european-parliament-and-council-13-june-2024-laying-down"], "quota_units": 1, "cost_eur": null, "wall_seconds": 16.7, "total_tokens": 860, "status": "COMPLETED"}
{"task_id": "inq-law-10", "arm": "CONTROL", "output": "The claim is incorrect. Under Article 8 of the GDPR, the default age for a child's consent to information society services is 16. Member States are permitted to lower this threshold by law, provided the age is not below 13, but the GDPR default itself is 16.\n\nVERDICT: REFUTED\nKEY: 16", "attempts": [{"success": false, "failure_class": "RATE_LIMITED", "provider": "kilo-gateway", "model": "poolside/laguna-s-2.1:free", "decision_id": "decision_171c409646234508a3bd16bf2ea7d335"}, {"success": false, "failure_class": "MODEL_NOT_FOUND", "provider": "google", "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite", "decision_id": "decision_90f710ea7c6f4cd1807237bc8337db7e"}, {"success": true, "failure_class": null, "provider": "google", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "decision_id": "decision_138907f60a1b49519041aeb007b7bc90"}], "grounded_source_refs": [], "quota_units": 3, "cost_eur": null, "wall_seconds": 15.03, "total_tokens": 258, "status": "COMPLETED"}
{"task_id": "inq-sci-06", "arm": "CONTROL", "output": "The claim states that oxygen has atomic number 16. To evaluate this, recall that the atomic number corresponds to the number of protons in an atom's nucleus. Oxygen, with the chemical symbol O, is element 8 on the periodic table. Its atomic number is 8, not 16. The value 16 is actually the atomic mass of oxygen (approximately), which represents the sum of protons and neutrons, not the atomic number. \n\nVERDICT: REFUTED\nKEY: 8", "attempts": [{"success": false, "failure_class": "PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE", "provider": "google", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "decision_id": "decision_4df4985d4a374c1d9fa35a701f49576c"}, {"success": true, "failure_class": null, "provider": "kilo-gateway", "model": "poolside/laguna-xs-2.1:free", "decision_id": "decision_d522ad8f33084b9f8ebd83824b9864ec"}], "grounded_source_refs": [], "quota_units": 2, "cost_eur": null, "wall_seconds": 15.15, "total_tokens": 284, "status": "COMPLETED"}
